{"id":"e0062aaf09566683","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-coinitial-subset.md","title":"ZFC Coinitial Subset","display":"df-zfc-coinitial-subset — ZFC Coinitial Subset","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-coinitial-subset","aliases":["58-df-zfc-coinitial-subset","58-df-zfc-rel-coinitial-subset"],"display":"df-zfc-coinitial-subset — ZFC Coinitial Subset","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-subset]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-coinitial-subset"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-coinitial-subset</span><span>58-df-zfc-rel-coinitial-subset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-coinitial-subset — ZFC Coinitial Subset"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d35b78cf8312c12b\" href=\"?note=d35b78cf8312c12b\" title=\"58-df-subset\">58-df-subset</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,L,\\leq_L\\in V\">\\(A,L,\\leq_L\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_L\\subseteq L\\times L\">\\(\\leq_L\\subseteq L\\times L\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CoinitialSubset}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcRelCoinitialSubset}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{CoinitialSubset}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcRelCoinitialSubset}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}coinitial\\text{-}subset} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{CoinitialSubset}_S(A,L,\\leq_L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\leq_L\\subseteq L\\times L\\land A\\subseteq L\\land\\forall x\\in L\\;\\exists a\\in A\\;(a\\leq_L x)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}coinitial\\text{-}subset} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{CoinitialSubset}_S(A,L,\\leq_L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\leq_L\\subseteq L\\times L\\land A\\subseteq L\\land\\forall x\\in L\\;\\exists a\\in A\\;(a\\leq_L x)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}coinitial\\text{-}subset\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRelCoinitialSubset}_S(A,L,\\leq_L)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CoinitialSubset}_S(A,L,\\leq_L)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}coinitial\\text{-}subset\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRelCoinitialSubset}_S(A,L,\\leq_L)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CoinitialSubset}_S(A,L,\\leq_L)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The alias uses the same declared carrier, subset, and order relation; the former assertion introduced three undeclared symbols.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-rel-coinitial-subset</code> is merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-subset","status":"resolved","id":"d35b78cf8312c12b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-subset]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,L,\\leq_L\\in V","display":